{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.poster.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.webm?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.mp4?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the desk of VValak Lizardtongue, Grand Shepherd of the Tyrythian Empire:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well this is just complete and utter <strong>bulls**t</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those <i>idiotic, moronic </i>Terranoids think they can just roll in here and take over my beautiful Tyrythian kingdom? The kingdom that I built from the ground up with <i>my bare hands</i>, and only sort of inherited from my dear, sweet, extremely dead father?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I mention that this is <strong>bulls**t</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fine though, because what they don\u2019t realize is that I am going to make them very, very dead. Along with my trusty sidekick and childhood nursing bot Milky \u2013 please do not ask me questions about that \u2013 I will whizz over to Earth, turn it into a stinking pile of rubble, and be back home in time for a warm glass of milk before bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.poster.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.webm?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.mp4?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth Must Die</strong> is the story of my glorious rise to power (off the back of my <i>adored</i> father\u2019s passing), my subsequent <i>accidental</i> surrender to the Terranoids, and my infamous revenge against Earth and everything it stands for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apparently the story is retold in the form of one of those old point and click adventure games that people gave a sh*t about in the 1990s, I wanna say? But in 2026. Doesn\u2019t sound like a good idea to me, but what do I know \u2013 I\u2019m just a benevolent, terrifying leader of worlds who everyone loves and also super respects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m also not sure what the phrase <strong>\u201cBritish comedy royalty\u201d</strong> is supposed to mean, but I guess they got a bunch of \u201cfunny\u201d f*ckwits to dub over my glorious voyage to feed the Terranoids their own bumholes? Let me just copy/paste the list here so I don\u2019t have to give them any more time and effort than they deserve:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2a77aadcec0c454db0e961a47e94b373.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1200 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I not have someone to do this for me? Anyway, apparently my magnificent story is told over a series of many hours, and you click a bunch and things happen and really I don\u2019t care about any of this, I\u2019m just here for the glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you experience my unbelievably cool story through whatever this is, something called \u201cSteam\u201d? It's apparently how you accessed experiences like this back in 2025. Sounds primitive, but I guess every civilization has to start as gross slugs crawling their way onto the banks of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VValak signing off.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wistful Thinking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/770e2eac6bd4be1a4eafe5745f6356f8e52e4025.jpg"},{"name":"Bookworm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/3fcd7329b7106a1608f6e055a6c1c5615b4c7171.jpg"},{"name":"Dedicated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/ab209cf65057079ceb05c1f478a4bee6f9086a0c.jpg"},{"name":"Bum Note","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/d04ed569755ccd16bbd1160d543b7eda98fa7f5b.jpg"},{"name":"Buzzcut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/4c23227a6074cdb50babd990e6653ebd820e1e31.jpg"},{"name":"Gagster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/dd2984da51e3bcfd1d03ebb5ef3df5f024bcda2d.jpg"},{"name":"Brace yourself, Rodney","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/b7c913ca917b7058f1e5faa6f564458f5bf2e1cd.jpg"},{"name":"I have invented a manoeuvre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/adbd77e40f22216e6062da9a96e8aee86210ccc0.jpg"},{"name":"Over-Keen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/b20ff25a1e563a0dda1c26d9f8df0e37866c7a87.jpg"},{"name":"Rude","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3639780/befd61c6cbcda54435bb6709b3d788ab980aa27f.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639780?t=1769538597","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639780?t=1769538597","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/0da0d60c2dead891ffc7f417bc733cdda8f88d10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769538597","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/0da0d60c2dead891ffc7f417bc733cdda8f88d10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769538597","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There is a puzzle that takes place in an alien adult bookshop, and an alien orgy depicted as a gyrating lump on the floor. "},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4057540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.poster.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.webm?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2cbfa286242c6d596cc4b37568de8f58.mp4?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From the desk of VValak Lizardtongue, Grand Shepherd of the Tyrythian Empire:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well this is just complete and utter <strong>bulls**t</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those <i>idiotic, moronic </i>Terranoids think they can just roll in here and take over my beautiful Tyrythian kingdom? The kingdom that I built from the ground up with <i>my bare hands</i>, and only sort of inherited from my dear, sweet, extremely dead father?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I mention that this is <strong>bulls**t</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s fine though, because what they don\u2019t realize is that I am going to make them very, very dead. Along with my trusty sidekick and childhood nursing bot Milky \u2013 please do not ask me questions about that \u2013 I will whizz over to Earth, turn it into a stinking pile of rubble, and be back home in time for a warm glass of milk before bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.poster.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.webm?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/c9af7cb80dc11b49da6c5cbe07279a23.mp4?t=1769538597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth Must Die</strong> is the story of my glorious rise to power (off the back of my <i>adored</i> father\u2019s passing), my subsequent <i>accidental</i> surrender to the Terranoids, and my infamous revenge against Earth and everything it stands for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apparently the story is retold in the form of one of those old point and click adventure games that people gave a sh*t about in the 1990s, I wanna say? But in 2026. Doesn\u2019t sound like a good idea to me, but what do I know \u2013 I\u2019m just a benevolent, terrifying leader of worlds who everyone loves and also super respects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m also not sure what the phrase <strong>\u201cBritish comedy royalty\u201d</strong> is supposed to mean, but I guess they got a bunch of \u201cfunny\u201d f*ckwits to dub over my glorious voyage to feed the Terranoids their own bumholes? Let me just copy/paste the list here so I don\u2019t have to give them any more time and effort than they deserve:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/extras/2a77aadcec0c454db0e961a47e94b373.avif?t=1769538597\" width=1200 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How do I not have someone to do this for me? Anyway, apparently my magnificent story is told over a series of many hours, and you click a bunch and things happen and really I don\u2019t care about any of this, I\u2019m just here for the glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you experience my unbelievably cool story through whatever this is, something called \u201cSteam\u201d? It's apparently how you accessed experiences like this back in 2025. Sounds primitive, but I guess every civilization has to start as gross slugs crawling their way onto the banks of the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VValak signing off.</strong></p>","developers":["Size Five Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639780/648eba45b3be2bb15114260b262a35d71bf98432/header.jpg?t=1769538597","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3639780/1817460903/4051e467257ea42ae902f7be60d944019b8f7fd4/1758811172/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759074558","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3639780/1817460903/4051e467257ea42ae902f7be60d944019b8f7fd4/1758811172/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759074558","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3639780/1817460903/4051e467257ea42ae902f7be60d944019b8f7fd4/1758811172/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759074558","id":257206233,"name":"Announce Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta